{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06939","headline":"古意 · 常建","name":"古意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"井底玉冰洞地明，琥珀辘轳青丝索。\n仙人骑凤披彩霞，挽上银瓶照天阁。\n黄金作身双飞龙，口衔明月喷芙蓉。\n一时渡海望不见，晓上青楼十二重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}